00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:51.710
Doug Jeffrey, Vice President
for External Affairs,

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.210
also for inviting me.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.910
And for the entire staff
at external affairs.

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:59.280
Obviously, we would not be here
without what they're doing.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.582
This is fantastic.

00:02:00.582 --> 00:02:02.540
I do also want to point
out over there, though,

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:05.240
I can't see right now,
because of the lighting.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:08.509
My beautiful wife, my
lovely wife, Dedra,

00:02:08.509 --> 00:02:09.590
is right over here.

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.090
And she's been bouncing--

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:15.500
or allowing me to bounce ideas
off of her for several years

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:19.220
now actually, maybe more
than we would care to admit.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:20.730
And she's been great.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:23.510
I also want to point out
my very lovely depart--

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:27.400
not lovely, sorry, my
manly department chair,

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.870
Mark Kalthoff, back
there, as well,

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.330
for being very supportive.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:34.730
And I just-- I have to
point out two other people.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:38.900
Tom Connor is here, and he will
